Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Fast Startup off — stutter/stability hygiene
; Source: appears in Aphrodite Aim Assist .bat (but that file also downloads malware — do NOT run it)
; Independently confirmed by MaxxTopia KEEP-CORE: "power.fast-startup.disable — stutter/stability hygiene"
; Registry: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Session Manager\Power\HiberbootEnabled
; Value 0 = Fast Startup disabled (keeps hibernation available, unlike powercfg /hibernate off).
; Default 1 = Fast Startup enabled (can cause stale driver state on boot).
; Revert: set back to 1

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Session Manager\Power]
"HiberbootEnabled"=dword:00000000
